 observados y esperados es 7,2, con un intervalo de confianza del 95 % de 4,6 a 11,4. En diciembre se adjudicó el 13 % de los contratos junto al límite, mientras que diciembre supone el 19 % de todos sus contratos de servicios y suministros. Los contratos junto al límite se reparten entre 37 adjudicatarios distintos. El contrato [1], de 14.973 euros, se adjudicó en diciembre de 2025.\nQué no pueden demostrar: La concentración de contratos al límite no indica malas prácticas. Puede deberse a criterios de mercado o necesidades específicas. No refleja actos ilícitos ni decisiones equivocadas.\nQué se puede revisar: Comprobar si los contratos al límite abarcan la misma necesidad. Verificar si el adjudicatario A repite contratos en otros sectores. Analizar si los contratos de diciembre se ajustan a presupuestos cerrados o a nuevas demandas.","en":"What the data shows: Between 2023 and 2025, this body awarded 52 minor contracts for services and supplies above 14,000 and up to 15,000 euros, just under the legal limit. If those amounts were spread as in the band immediately below, 7.2 contracts would be expected. The observed-to-expected ratio is 7.2, with a 95% confidence interval of 4.6 to 11.4. December accounts for 13% of the contracts just under the limit, compared with 19% of all its services and supplies contracts. The awardee with the most contracts just under the limit, called awardee A here, has 3. Contract [1], for 14,973 euros, was awarded in December 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The concentration of contracts in December does not indicate improper activity. Similar patterns can occur naturally due to seasonal demand or budget cycles. Small amounts near the limit do not prove violations, as market prices or budget constraints may justify them.\nWhat can be checked: Check the dates and values of December contracts to see if they align with other contracts. Review awardee A's contracts to determine if they repeat the same service or need. Look for patterns in contract types to assess if multiple contracts serve the same purpose.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"ss","citas":["HLAc2T0LPd1Vq4S9zvaQpQ%3D%3D","TV4wWQrzJy6P%2Bo96UAV7cQ%3D%3D","8Sx4q1tVmtjyoM4us5k4vw%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}